    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thank you to everyone who played the demo and shared your warm messages of feedback and support. In order to bring this game to you sooner, we are delighted to bring forward the release date to Friday, September 4, 2026.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In light of this change, the pre-order bonus for the digital version of the game will be changed to an Early Adopter Bonus available until the date and time specified below:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "PDT: September 25, 2026, 4:59 PM",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "EDT: September 25, 2026, 7:59 PM",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "BST: September 26, 2026, 00:59: The demo version currently available will receive an update in the future. Please note, this update will not include any new content. Players who keep the save data from the demo version will get a bonus to use in the full game.: The game's launch is two months away! We thank you for your continued support of Onimusha: Way of the Sword.: https://store.steampowered.com/app/2638890/_Way_of_the_Sword/",
